SCP IDEA: 


20 Nov 2020 21:46






I have an idea for a SCP and I'm looking for feedback. The SCP is a small village in Siberia. The village is populated by human-like creatures. The longer you stay in the village the more it starts to figure out your personality. It will slowly form itself to fit your ideal town. As time goes on the village is almost like a paradise for you. If you try to leave the people in the village will take you to a room and turn you into one of them. If you don't try to leave you slowly transform and become one of the people there. Basically, the village doesn't want you to leave. It learns about you to keep you from leaving. What do you guys think?







